<http://data.silknow.org/object/833a2621-50a7-3658-97cf-ffc3af0f90e5>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Silk damask valance in green with a pattern of large stylised leaves. Edged with a narrow cream silk woven braid at the top, with a short fringe, and at the bottom is a long fringe (4 inches). Applied wide cream silk ribbon with diamond shapes forms a pattern following contours of scallops with swirling curves. Lining of cream silk. Label attached with 'J. H. INC.'."@en , "Silk damask valance, possibly made in France or Italy, 1730-1770"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/f8de82f8-b970-36d5-95a1-e3d8de646c88> ;
